WEBVTT

00:00:00.747 --> 00:00:05.324
An agent can test its own work in the session's browser.

00:00:05.324 --> 00:00:10.963
It opens pages, clicks, types and reads the console, while you watch.

00:00:11.324 --> 00:00:13.103
Open the session's browser.

00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:17.454
The agent may only use it once you switch it on, for this session.

00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:28.836
Now give the agent its task, and ask it to check the result in the browser itself.

00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:38.028
Switch back to the browser, and watch.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:49.729
The agent wrote the code, loaded the app in this tab, added a note, and saw the count go up.

00:00:49.729 --> 00:00:51.378
It's all there to see.

00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:03.540
Its summary says what it checked, and it committed its work.

00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:07.422
When you're done, switch it off again.

00:01:07.422 --> 00:01:14.039
Using the browser yourself, or pressing Stop while the agent works, switches it off too.
